      "description": "Industrial & Commercial Services — Trained, Supervised Moving and Warehouse Teams for industrial and commercial project support: warehouse and distribution, commercial relocation and logistics including white-glove/blanket-wrap, FF&E installation and project support, and flexible workforce deployment, priced per job with no required contract duration. Standard Job Pricing: Unload $8.00/CWT, Load $10.00/CWT, APU $12.00/CWT, Residential/Driver Meet $400-$425 per man."
